---
/* One line of product copy. The rules themselves live in
   station/docs/wire-contract.md (Semantics); this band links there
   instead of restating them. */
---

<section class="station-principles" aria-label="Principles">
  <div class="station-principles-inner section-inner">
    <span class="station-principles-label">Principles</span>
    <p class="station-principles-copy">
      Stations report what they measure and why they are down, and your site decides the
      words, units, colours, and wind bands. The <a href="/docs/station/wire-contract/">wire contract</a> sets out the rules in full.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .station-principles-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: max-content minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(1.1rem, 2.5vw, 1.75rem);
    align-items: baseline;
    padding-block: clamp(1.6rem, 3.5vw, 2.4rem);
  }
  .station-principles-label {
    font: 600 0.66rem/1.6 var(--mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-mute);
  }
  .station-principles-copy {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 46rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .station-principles-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; row-gap: 0.5rem; }
  }
</style>
